=== Operation Specifications <sec-a-pay-ops>

@tbl-a-pay-ops specifies the eight operations that carry Pay upfront's rules, in the layout of @tbl-a-uc03-ops. `lockQuote` is specified here because preparation (B2) is where it is called. Signatures are those in the code. Errors are `BizException` error codes, enum constant first and wire code in brackets on first use, unless named as another exception.

